{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_1","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"氣府論篇第五十九","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_2","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"足太陽脈氣所發者，七十八穴。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_3","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"兩眉頭各一。","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_4","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"入髮至項三寸半傍五，相去三寸。","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_5","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"其浮氣在皮中者，凡五行，行五，五五二十五。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_6","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"項中大筋兩旁，各一。","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_7","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"風府兩旁，各一。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_8","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"俠背以下至尻尾二十一節，十五間各一，五臟之俞各五，六腑之俞各六。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_9","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"委中以下至足小趾旁，各六俞。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_10","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"足少陽脈氣所發者，六十二穴，兩角上各二。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_11","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"直目上髮際內各五。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_12","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"耳前角上各一。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_13","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"耳前角下各一。","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_14","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"銳髮下，各一。","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_15","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"客主人，各一。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_16","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"耳後陷中，各一。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_17","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"下關各一。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_18","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"耳下牙車之後，各一。","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_19","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"缺盆各一。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_20","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"掖下三寸，脅下至胠，八間各一。","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_21","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"髀樞中傍，各一。","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_22","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"膝以下至足小趾次趾各六俞。","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_23","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"足陽明脈氣血所發者，六十八穴，額顱髮際旁各三。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_24","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"面鼽骨空各一。","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_25","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"大迎之骨空各一。","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_26","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"人迎各一。","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_27","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"缺盆外骨空各一。","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_28","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"膺中骨間各一。","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_29","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"俠鳩尾之外，當乳下三寸，俠胃脘各五。","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_30","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"俠臍廣三寸，各三。","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_31","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"下齊二寸，俠之各三。","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_32","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"氣街動脈各一。","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_33","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"伏兔上各一。","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_34","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"三里以下至足中趾各八俞，分之所在穴空。","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_35","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"手太陽脈氣所發者，三十六穴，目內眥各一。","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_36","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"目外各一。","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_37","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"鼽骨下各一。","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_38","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"耳郭上各一。","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_39","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"耳中各一。","sortOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_40","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"巨骨穴各一。","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_41","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"曲掖上骨穴各一。","sortOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_42","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"柱骨上陷者各一。","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_43","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"上天窗四寸，各一。","sortOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_44","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"肩解各一。","sortOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_45","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"肩解下三寸，各一。","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_46","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"肘以下至手小指本各六俞。","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_47","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"手陽明脈氣所發者，二十二穴。鼻空外廉項上，各二。","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_48","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"大迎骨空各一。","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_49","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"柱骨之會各一。","sortOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_50","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"髃骨之會各一。","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_51","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"肘以下至手大指次指本各六俞。","sortOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_52","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"手少陽脈氣所發者三十二穴，鼽骨下各一。","sortOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_53","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"眉後各一。","sortOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_54","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"角上各一。","sortOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_55","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"下完骨後各一。","sortOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_56","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"項中足太陽之前各一。","sortOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_57","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"俠扶突各一。","sortOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_58","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"肩貞各一。","sortOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_59","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"肩貞下三寸分間各一。","sortOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_60","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"肘以下至手小指次指本各六俞。","sortOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_61","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"督脈氣所發者，二十八穴。","sortOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_62","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"項中央二。","sortOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_63","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"髮際後中八。","sortOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_64","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"面中三。","sortOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_65","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"大椎以下至尻尾及旁十五穴。","sortOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_66","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"至骶下凡二十一節脊椎法也。","sortOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_67","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"任脈之氣所發者，二十八穴，喉中央二。","sortOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_68","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"膺中骨陷中各一。","sortOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_69","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"鳩尾下三寸，胃脘五寸，胃脘以下至橫骨六寸半一，腹脈法也。","sortOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_70","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"下陰別一。","sortOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_71","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"目下各一。","sortOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_72","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"下唇一。","sortOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_73","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"斷交一。","sortOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_74","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"沖脈氣所發者，二十二穴。俠鳩尾外各半寸，至齊寸一。","sortOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_75","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"俠齊下旁各五分，至橫骨寸一，腹脈法也。","sortOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_76","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"足少陰舌下。","sortOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_77","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"厥陰毛中急脈各一。","sortOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_78","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"手少陰各一。","sortOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_79","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"陰陽蹻各一。","sortOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_80","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"手足諸魚際脈氣所發者。","sortOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_59_81","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_59","text":"凡三百六十五穴也。","sortOrder":81}],"overrides":{}}